<p class="mainCellContentsTitle">Submit 
        a Paper</p>
      <p class="mainCellContents">ECJ is Stanford's first electrical engineering 
        and computer science research journal. Submit a paper of your research 
        to increase awareness of your project and a chance to receive a scholarship 
        grant.</p>
      <p class="mainCellContentsTitle"><strong>Why should you submit?</strong></p>
      <UL>
        <LI>Increase the exposure of your groundbreaking research project.</LI>
        <LI>Sizeable scholarship grants for the top papers.</LI>
        <LI>ECJ has a rapid review process. Typical journals have long turn around 
          times ranging from months to years.</LI>
        <LI>Rare opportunity for research paper to be reviewed by top EE and CS 
          professors in the world.</LI>
        <LI>Make an impact on campus and the global technical community. Work 
          will be displayed for peers and faculty viewing in the Terman Engineering 
          Library.</LI>
      </UL></td>
